# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:7
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_085fd420:

    # "...After putting our names down on the sheet, we made our way down into the darkness of the sewers and traversed deeper with torches lit."
    "…名簿に名前を記入した後、我々は下水道の闇の中へと足を踏み入れ、松明を灯して奥へと進んだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:12
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_cb7c5a3b:

    # "We walked alongside the stagnant waters which flowed quietly through the main grates of the complex network of tunnels beneath Novaras."
    "ノヴァラスの地下に広がる網目状のトンネル群、その主要な排水路を緩やかに流れる淀んだ水の傍らを、我々は歩いていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:13
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_84faa749:

    # "Every now and then, we heard the scurrying of feet as shadows moved across the walls fleeing from the light."
    "時折、壁を走る影が光から逃げるように、慌ただしい足音が聞こえた。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:14
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_b756e9f7:

    # "The wretched smell of rotting flesh grew stronger and stronger, the repulsive scent almost forcing me to hurl from its stench."
    "腐敗した肉の嫌な臭いがどんどん強くなり、その悪臭に吐き気を催すほどだった。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:15
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_4e2d70e2:

    # "Finally, as we turned one of the corners, we were confronted by the hideous sight of a mound of corpses, festering and rotting as one of the large rats dragged by it's teeth a corpse to add to the pile."
    "曲がり角を一つ回り切った時、私たちはついに忌まわしい光景に直面した。それは腐敗し、朽ち果てていく死体の山で、大きな鼠の一匹が歯で死体を引きずりながらその山に加えようとしていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:16
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_2c2ba668:

    # "The dozens of rats feasting and gnawing at the flesh, turned their heads to look up towards us and snarled."
    "何十匹もの鼠が肉塊を貪り喰らい、齧りついていたが、一斉にこちらの方へと首を上げ、牙を剥いて唸り声を上げた。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:18
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_b6ebbac8:

    # "...After putting my name down on the sheet, I made my way down into the darkness of the sewers and traversed deeper with torches lit."
    "……名を書き入れると、私は暗闇へと足を踏み入れて、松明を灯しながらさらに奥へと進み続けた。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:23
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_89d13341:

    # "I walked alongside the stagnant waters which flowed quietly through the main grates of the complex network of tunnels beneath Novaras."
    "淀んだ水路を、私はノヴァラスの地下トンネル網の主要グレート沿いに静かに流れるそれに沿って歩いた。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:24
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_4ff8f4c3:

    # "Every now and then, I heard the scurrying of feet as shadows moved across the walls fleeing from the light."
    "時折、壁を横切る影が光から逃れるように足音をパタパタとさせて走り去るのが聞こえた。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:25
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_b756e9f7_1:

    # "The wretched smell of rotting flesh grew stronger and stronger, the repulsive scent almost forcing me to hurl from its stench."
    "腐敗した肉の嫌な臭いはますます強くなり、その悪臭に吐き気を催す程度に不愉快だった。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:26
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_042948f6:

    # "Finally, as I turned one of the corners, I was confronted by the hideous sight of a mound of corpses, festering and rotting as one of the large rats dragged by it's teeth a corpse to add to the pile."
    "やがて、角を曲がった先で、私はおぞましい光景に直面した。亡骸の山が腐敗し朽ちていく中、一匹の大きな鼠が歯で死体をくわえ、その山へと引きずっていくのだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:27
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_7d39c581:

    # "The dozens of rats feasting and gnawing at the flesh, turned their heads to look up towards me and snarled."
    "数十匹の鼠が肉を貪り食い、齧りつきながら、一斉に首を上げて私を見上げ、唸り声を上げた。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:31
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_96622ec7:

    # ELENA @ shock "Oh gods ..."
    ELENA @ shock "神よ…"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:32
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_c66c3ea0:

    # ELENA @ shock "There's so many of them!"
    ELENA @ shock "やつらがなんてたくさん!"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:36
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_e5cd033b:

    # MYU @ scared "M-Myu!"
    MYU @ scared "M、ミュ!"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:43
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_e470a966:

    # MC "(Fuck!)"
    MC "(くそ!)"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:45
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_b5e51ab2:

    # MC "STAND READY TO FIGHT!"
    MC "戦闘準備完了!"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:53
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_460723ef:

    # "Atop their slain kins corpses, more clambered their way towards us, frothing at the mouth."
    "同胞の屍を踏みしだき、なおも我々へとよじ登ってくる。口から泡を吹いて。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:57
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_c49d8ac9:

    # MC "(They just keep coming!)"
    MC "(次から次へと現れる!)"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:61
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_1c42b967:

    # "The sewer became a haze of red and blood as I tore my way through dozens more of the creatures."
    "下水道は赤と血の霞みに包まれ、俺はさらに何十体もの化け物を引き裂きながら駆け抜けた。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:65
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_287c0477:

    # "The red mist enveloped me as the rage swept over, digging my hands into the guts of one of the creatures before tearing it in two."
    "赤い霧が私を包み込み、怒りが襲いかかる中、一匹の内臓に手を突っ込むと、そのまま真っ二つに引き裂いた。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:68
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_b0e488d1:

    # ELENA @ shock "How many more of them are there?!"
    ELENA @ shock "まだ何人いるんだ？!"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:72
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_47abd27b:

    # MARKUS @ angry "Grghh! Burn! FUCKING BURN YOU RODENT FUCKS!"
    MARKUS @ angry "くそ!燃えろ!クソネズミ共が燃え尽きろ!"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:75
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_f7a51131:

    # "The next wave came hurtling over, leaping onto me where they gnashed and mauled trying to force their way through my armor."
    "次の波が襲いかかり、鎧を食い破ろうと喰いちぎり、引き裂きながら、我が身に躍りかかった。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:79
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_eefe4a77:

    # "Throwing them off me, I stomped down on one beneath my feet, crushing its skull before I saw once again, another wave charging towards us..."
    "彼らを振り払い、足元の一体を踏み潰して頭蓋骨を砕くと、またもや新たな波が我々に向かって突進してくるのが見えた…"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:81
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_79a800ff:

    # MC "They're thinning out! Just a little more!"
    MC "まばらになってきた!もう少しだ!"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:85
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_55f1e704:

    # "Slaying the last of this wave, the remaining rats turned and fled deeper into the darkness of the sewers."
    "この波の最後の一匹を討ち果たすと、残りの鼠たちは背を向け、下水道の暗闇へと逃げ去っていった。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:90
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_2d761257:

    # MC "{i}*Huff* *Huff*{/i}"
    MC "{i}ハッ、ハッ{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:91
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_ba69243c:

    # MC "(I thought they'd never stop coming...)"
    MC "(いつまでも続くかと思った…)"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:94
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_0a80a6d6:

    # MARKUS "Well, job well done I guess."
    MARKUS "まあ、うまくやったと思うよ。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:95
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_e5af19f1:

    # MARKUS @ shock "Now can we get out of here now before they decide they'd like to give eating us another go?"
    MARKUS @ shock "そろそろここを出ようか、奴らがまた我々を狙ってくる前に。ねえ？"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:99
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_d6ab0143:

    # MYU @ scared "Myu isn't very tasty!"
    MYU @ scared "ミュは美味しくない!"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:102
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_3473bfb5:

    # MC "Let's take a head or two for proof and be done with this quest already!"
    MC "首一つ二つ証拠に持って行くだけで、この依頼を済ませてしまえばいいんじゃないか!"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:110
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_8bdfd3b5:

    # "Shortly after, exhausted from the gruelling experience, we made our way back to the surface and after presenting a few heads of the rats, took our reward."
    "間もなく、過酷な体験で疲れ果てた私たちは地上へと上がってきて、ネズミの首を数個提示した後、報酬を受け取った。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Rodents/scr.rpy:112
translate ja qst_guild_rodents_5fd8b026:

    # "Shortly after, exhausted from the gruelling experience, I made my way back to the surface and after presenting a few heads of the rats, took my reward."
    "しばらくして、厳しい体験に疲れ果てて、私は地上に戻り、ねずみの頭をいくつか提出することで、報酬を受け取った。"

